# Build context hygiene: keep host artifacts, secrets and VCS data out of every image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-dev
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.hermes
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets: never send real env files to the Docker daemon. Only the template is allowed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed to build or run any image.
docs
tests
tools
infrastructure
*.md
